        <title type="html"><![CDATA[HTML conformance/style fixes]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41754</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41754"/>
        <updated>2025-10-31T10:02:37.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><ul dir="auto">
<li>Lowercase DOCTYPE per style guide</li>
<li>Buttons must have accessible name</li>
<li>Scripts don't need <code class="notranslate">type="text/javascript"</code></li>
<li>Boolean attributes should be specified without value</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">id</code>s should be valid CSS identifiers for convenience</li>
<li>Avoid deprecated attributes like <code class="notranslate">align</code> and <code class="notranslate">frameborder</code></li>
<li>Avoid invalid attributes, especially with <code class="notranslate">&lt;source&gt;</code> elements: they have different valid attributes depending on the parent, so the parent element should be explicit</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">&lt;img&gt;</code> elements require <code class="notranslate">src</code> and <code class="notranslate">alt</code>; <code class="notranslate">&lt;a&gt;</code> elements require <code class="notranslate">href</code></li>
<li>Fix some invalid nesting involving <code class="notranslate">&lt;label&gt;</code> and <code class="notranslate">&lt;button&gt;</code> permitted contents and <code class="notranslate">&lt;th&gt;</code> permitted parents</li>
</ul>]]></content>
